<title>USA: New York Health Care Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>New York Health Care Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended</p>
<p>						 3/31/97	  3/31/96</p>
<p>Net patient service revenue	  $3,086,034     $2,987,065</p>
<p>Net income				     62,816	  248,350</p>
<p>Net income per common share and common</p>
<p>share equivalents (proforma</p>
<p> for March 31, 1996)			   $.02	     $.04</p>
<p>Weighted average number of common shares</p>
<p> and common share equivalents	 3,773,437	3,402,659</p>
<p>NOTE: Pro forma earnings per share for the prior period reflect company's initial public offering in December 1996.</p>
<p>Full name is New York Health Care Inc.</p>
</text>
